title: "GenStation"
abstract: >-
  A native macOS and iOS client for cloud and local AI image and video generation
  (Google Gemini, xAI Grok, AI/ML API and ComfyUI), with a local generation history
  and an optional macOS Model Context Protocol (MCP) bridge for AI agents.
type: software
authors:
